{"id":"28dbc431d5ab401c","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-lil-2random.md","title":"随机序列的重对数律","display":"thm-lil-2random — 随机序列的重对数律","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-lil-2random","aliases":["43-thm-lil-2random"],"display":"thm-lil-2random — 随机序列的重对数律","depends_on":["[[43-df-2random]]","[[43-thm-lil-schnorr]]","[[43-thm-randomhierarchy]]","[[43-df-nrandom]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"本地推导：由43-thm-lil-schnorr及2随机⇒ML随机⇒Schnorr随机；LIL外部一手来源为Persiau–Zaffora Blando (2025), §3.1 Corollary 29前；https://doi.org/10.1093/logcom/exae083","source_scope":"local-supplement","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_proof_checked":false,"external_source_url":"https://doi.org/10.1093/logcom/exae083"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-lil-2random"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-lil-2random</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-lil-2random — 随机序列的重对数律"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c6460737e81fabbf\" href=\"?note=c6460737e81fabbf\" title=\"43-df-2random\">43-df-2random</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9d0e5864511f16e3\" href=\"?note=9d0e5864511f16e3\" title=\"43-thm-lil-schnorr\">43-thm-lil-schnorr</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e664edf227d0e59a\" href=\"?note=e664edf227d0e59a\" title=\"43-thm-randomhierarchy\">43-thm-randomhierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"86bdc33f83ee57a9\" href=\"?note=86bdc33f83ee57a9\" title=\"43-df-nrandom\">43-df-nrandom</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"本地推导：由43-thm-lil-schnorr及2随机⇒ML随机⇒Schnorr随机；LIL外部一手来源为Persiau–Zaffora Blando (2025), §3.1 Corollary 29前；<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1093/logcom/exae083\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://doi.org/10.1093/logcom/exae083</a>"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"local-supplement"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"external_source_url","html":"<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1093/logcom/exae083\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://doi.org/10.1093/logcom/exae083</a>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_n\">\\(S_n\\)</span> 为下式定义的对称随机游走部分和，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\log\">\\(\\log\\)</span> 是自然对数，极限从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge3\">\\(n\\ge3\\)</span> 取。随机性谓词见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c6460737e81fabbf\" href=\"?note=c6460737e81fabbf\" title=\"43-df-2random\">43-df-2random</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Random}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Random}_n\\)</span> 是由正整数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 索引的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\omega\">\\(2^\\omega\\)</span> 上布尔谓词族，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"86bdc33f83ee57a9\" href=\"?note=86bdc33f83ee57a9\" title=\"43-df-nrandom\">43-df-nrandom</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S_n(X):=\\sum_{i&lt;n}(2X(i)-1)\\qquad(n\\in\\mathbb N,\\ X\\in2^\\omega).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S_n(X):=\\sum_{i&lt;n}(2X(i)-1)\\qquad(n\\in\\mathbb N,\\ X\\in2^\\omega).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Random}_2(X)\\Rightarrow\\left(\\limsup_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{S_n(X)}{\\sqrt{2n\\log\\log n}}=1\\land\\liminf_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{S_n(X)}{\\sqrt{2n\\log\\log n}}=-1\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Random}_2(X)\\Rightarrow\\left(\\limsup_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{S_n(X)}{\\sqrt{2n\\log\\log n}}=1\\land\\liminf_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{S_n(X)}{\\sqrt{2n\\log\\log n}}=-1\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>2随机性蕴含1随机性，后者蕴含Schnorr随机性，代入Schnorr-LIL即得。外部LIL陈述与本节点±1游走归一化已核对；不将此推论声称为用户2007草稿中的已定位定理。</p>\n<p>来源：本地推导：由43-thm-lil-schnorr及2随机⇒ML随机⇒Schnorr随机；LIL外部一手来源为Persiau–Zaffora Blando (2025), §3.1 Corollary 29前；<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1093/logcom/exae083\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://doi.org/10.1093/logcom/exae083</a>。本节点为书外补充或其本地推论；来源版本如上，未归入2007草稿的定理编号。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-2random","status":"resolved","id":"c6460737e81fabbf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-2random]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-thm-lil-schnorr","status":"resolved","id":"9d0e5864511f16e3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-thm-lil-schnorr]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-thm-randomhierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"e664edf227d0e59a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-thm-randomhierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-nrandom","status":"resolved","id":"86bdc33f83ee57a9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-nrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-2random","status":"resolved","id":"c6460737e81fabbf","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$，$S_n$ 为下式定义的对称随机游走部分和，$\\log$ 是自然对数，极限从 $n\\ge3$ 取。随机性谓词见 [[43-df-2random]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-nrandom","status":"resolved","id":"86bdc33f83ee57a9","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Random}_n$ 是由正整数 $n$ 索引的 $2^\\omega$ 上布尔谓词族，见 [[43-df-nrandom]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"S_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\log","display":false},{"tex":"n\\ge3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Random}_n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"S_n(X):=\\sum_{i<n}(2X(i)-1)\\qquad(n\\in\\mathbb N,\\ X\\in2^\\omega).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Random}_2(X)\\Rightarrow\\left(\\limsup_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{S_n(X)}{\\sqrt{2n\\log\\log n}}=1\\land\\liminf_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{S_n(X)}{\\sqrt{2n\\log\\log n}}=-1\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1887,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-211","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-lil-2random]] — 随机序列的重对数律"}],"outgoing":["c6460737e81fabbf","9d0e5864511f16e3","e664edf227d0e59a","86bdc33f83ee57a9"]}